end="00:48.020">the </span><span begin="00:48.020" end="00:48.470">idiot </span><span begin="00:48.470" end="00:48.830">right </span><span begin="00:48.830" end="00:49.070">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.190" end="00:51.170"><span begin="00:49.190" end="00:49.460">Too </span><span begin="00:49.460" end="00:49.640"> </span><span begin="00:49.640" end="00:49.700">f</span><span begin="00:49.700" end="00:49.700">*</span><span begin="00:49.700" end="00:49.700">*</span><span begin="00:49.700" end="00:49.760">ked </span><span begin="00:49.760" end="00:49.910">to </span><span begin="00:49.910" end="00:50.180">beg </span><span begin="00:50.180" end="00:50.300">and </span><span begin="00:50.300" end="00:50.420">not </span><span begin="00:50.420" end="00:50.750">afraid </span><span begin="00:50.750" end="00:50.840">to </span><span begin="00:50.840" end="00:51.080">care</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.170" end="00:53.090"><span begin="00:51.170" end="00:51.380">What's </span><span begin="00:51.380" end="00:51.470">the </span><span begin="00:51.470" end="00:51.680">matter </span><span begin="00:51.680" end="00:51.800">with </span><span begin="00:51.800" end="00:52.310">calamity </span><span begin="00:52.310" end="00:52.940">anyway</span><span begin="00:52.940" end="00:53.090">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.090" end="00:55.130"><span begin="00:53.090" end="00:53.480">Right</span><span begin="00:53.480" end="00:53.600">? </span><span begin="00:53.600" end="00:53.780">Get </span><span begin="00:53.780" end="00:53.840">the </span><span begin="00:53.840" end="00:53.990">f</span><span begin="00:53.990" end="00:53.990">*</span><span begin="00:53.990" end="00:53.990">*</span><span begin="00:53.990" end="00:54.110">k </span><span begin="00:54.110" end="00:54.260">outta </span><span begin="00:54.260" end="00:54.530">my </span><span begin="00:54.530" end="00:54.920">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.130" end="00:56.930"><span begin="00:55.130" end="00:55.640">Understand </span><span begin="00:55.670" end="00:55.790">I </span><span begin="00:55.790" end="00:56.090">can't </span><span begin="00:56.090" end="00:56.360">feel </span><span begin="00:56.360" end="00:56.810">anything</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.930" end="00:59.120"><span begin="00:56.930" end="00:57.110">It </span><span begin="00:57.110" end="00:57.290">isn't </span><span begin="00:57.290" end="00:57.440">like </span><span begin="00:57.440" end="00:57.500">I </span><span begin="00:57.500" end="00:57.740">wanna </span><span begin="00:57.740" end="00:58.040">sift </span><span begin="00:58.040" end="00:58.160">through </span><span begin="00:58.160" end="00:58.280">the </span><span begin="00:58.280" end="00:58.820">decay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.120" end="01:02.000"><span begin="00:59.120" end="00:59.270">I </span><span begin="00:59.270" end="00:59.480">feel </span><span begin="00:59.480" end="00:59.630">like </span><span begin="00:59.630" end="00:59.690">a </span><span begin="00:59.690" end="01:00.020">wound </span><span begin="01:00.020" end="01:00.170">like </span><span begin="01:00.170" end="01:00.230">I </span><span begin="01:00.230" end="01:00.530">got </span><span begin="01:00.530" end="01:00.560">a </span><span begin="01:00.560" end="01:00.620">f</span><span begin="01:00.620" end="01:00.620">*</span><span begin="01:00.620" end="01:00.620">*</span><span begin="01:00.620" end="01:00.710">king </span><span begin="01:00.710" end="01:01.010">gun </span><span begin="01:01.010" end="01:01.340">against </span><span begin="01:01.340" end="01:01.490">my </span><span begin="01:01.490" end="01:01.760">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.000" end="01:08.720"><span begin="01:02.000" end="01:03.120">You </span><span begin="01:03.120" end="01:04.240">live </span><span begin="01:04.240" end="01:05.360">when </span><span begin="01:05.360" end="01:06.480">I'm </span><span begin="01:06.480" end="01:07.600">dead</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.720" end="01:18.560"><span begin="01:08.720" end="01:09.230">One </span><span begin="01:09.230" end="01:09.500">more </span><span begin="01:09.500" end="01:09.950">time</span><span begin="01:09.950" end="01:09.950">, </span><span begin="01:09.950" end="01:10.190">motherf</span><span begin="01:10.190" end="01:10.190">*</span><span begin="01:10.190" end="01:10.190">*</span><span begin="01:10.190" end="01:10.250">ker</span><span begin="01:10.250" end="01:18.560">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.560" end="01:20.510"><span begin="01:18.560" end="01:18.980">Everybody </span><span begin="01:18.980" end="01:19.250">hates </span><span begin="01:19.250" end="01:19.310">me </span><span begin="01:19.310" end="01:19.340"> </span><span begin="01:19.340" end="01:19.640">now</span><span begin="01:19.640" end="01:19.640">, </span><span begin="01:19.640" end="01:19.880">so </span><span begin="01:19.880" end="01:19.940">f</span><span begin="01:19.940" end="01:20.150">*</span><span begin="01:20.150" end="01:20.360">*</span><span begin="01:20.360" end="01:20.420">k </span><span begin="01:20.420" end="01:20.510">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.510" end="01:21.770"><span begin="01:20.510" end="01:20.810">Blood's </span><span begin="01:20.810" end="01:20.870">on </span><span begin="01:20.870" end="01:20.960">my </span><span begin="01:20.960" end="01:21.140">face </span><span begin="01:21.140" end="01:21.230">and </span><span begin="01:21.230" end="01:21.320">my </span><span begin="01:21.320" end="01:21.770">hands</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.770" end="01:24.020"><span begin="01:21.770" end="01:21.890">And </span><span begin="01:21.890" end="01:21.920">I </span><span begin="01:21.920" end="01:22.190">don't </span><span begin="01:22.190" end="01:22.400">know </span><span begin="01:22.400" end="01:22.790">why </span><span begin="01:23.060" end="01:23.180">I'm </span><span begin="01:23.180" end="01:23.330">not </span><span begin="01:23.330" end="01:23.690">afraid </span><span begin="01:23.690" end="01:23.780">to </span><span begin="01:23.780" end="01:24.020">cry</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.020" end="01:25.940"><span begin="01:24.020" end="01:24.170">But </span><span begin="01:24.170" end="01:24.380">that's </span><span begin="01:24.380" end="01:24.590">none </span><span begin="01:24.590" end="01:24.650">of </span><span begin="01:24.650" end="01:24.830">your </span><span begin="01:24.830" end="01:25.940">business</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.940" end="01:28.760"><span begin="01:25.940" end="01:26.150">Whose </span><span begin="01:26.150" end="01:26.420">life </span><span begin="01:26.420" end="01:26.570">is </span><span begin="01:26.570" end="01:26.660">it</span><span begin="01:26.660" end="01:26.810">? </span><span begin="01:26.810" end="01:27.080">Get </span><span begin="01:27.080" end="01:27.200">it</span><span begin="01:27.200" end="01:27.260">? </span><span begin="01:27.260" end="01:27.530">See </span><span begin="01:27.530" end="01:27.800">it</span><span begin="01:27.800" end="01:27.800">? </span><span begin="01:27.800" end="01:28.100">Feel </span><span begin="01:28.100" end="01:28.220">it</span><span begin="01:28.220" end="01:28.220">? </span><span begin="01:28.220" end="01:28.280">Eat </span><span begin="01:28.280" end="01:28.340"> </span><span begin="01:28.340" end="01:28.760">it</span><span begin="01:28.760" end="01:28.760">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.760" end="01:30.920"><span begin="01:28.760" end="01:29.090">Spin </span><span begin="01:29.090" end="01:29.150">it </span><span begin="01:29.150" end="01:29.420">around </span><span begin="01:29.420" end="01:29.570">so </span><span begin="01:29.570" end="01:29.660">I </span><span begin="01:29.660" end="01:29.780">can </span><span begin="01:29.780" end="01:30.020">spit </span><span begin="01:30.020" end="01:30.110">in </span><span begin="01:30.110" end="01:30.260">its </span><span begin="01:30.260" end="01:30.740">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.920" end="01:32.450"><span begin="01:30.920" end="01:31.040">I </span><span begin="01:31.040" end="01:31.280">wanna </span><span begin="01:31.280" end="01:31.520">leave </span><span begin="01:31.520" end="01:31.850">without </span><span begin="01:31.850" end="01:31.910">a </span><span begin="01:31.910" end="01:32.420">trace</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.450" end="01:34.880"><span begin="01:32.450" end="01:32.840">'Cause </span><span begin="01:32.840" end="01:32.930">I </span><span begin="01:32.930" end="01:33.020">don't </span><span begin="01:33.020" end="01:33.230">wanna </span><span begin="01:33.230" end="01:33.500">die </span><span begin="01:33.500" end="01:33.620">in </span><span begin="01:33.620" end="01:33.920">this </span><span begin="01:33.920" end="01:34.880">place</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.880" end="01:45.710"><span begin="01:34.880" end="01:35.090">People </span><span begin="01:35.090" end="01:42.140"> </span><span begin="01:42.140" end="01:45.170">= </span><span begin="01:45.170" end="01:45.260">Sh</span><span begin="01:45.260" end="01:45.260">*</span><span begin="01:45.260" end="01:45.680">t</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.710" end="01:47.810"><span begin="01:45.710" end="01:46.060">People </span><span begin="01:46.060" end="01:46.410">= </span><span begin="01:46.410" end="01:46.760">Sh</span><span begin="01:46.760" end="01:47.110">*</span><span begin="01:47.110" end="01:47.460">t</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.810" end="01:49.610"><span begin="01:47.810" end="01:48.560">People </span><span begin="01:48.560" end="01:49.100">= </span><span begin="01:49.100" end="01:49.220">Sh</span><span begin="01:49.220" end="01:49.220">*</span><span begin="01:49.220" end="01:49.310">t</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.610" end="01:52.460"><span begin="01:49.610" end="01:50.300">People </span><span begin="01:50.300" end="01:51.290">= </span><span begin="01:51.290" end="01:51.380">Sh</span><span begin="01:51.380" end="01:51.710">*</span><span begin="01:51.710" end="01:52.460">t</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.460" end="01:54.350"><span begin="01:52.460" end="01:52.670">People </span><span begin="01:52.670" end="01:53.930">= </span><span begin="01:53.930" end="01:53.960">Sh</span><span begin="01:53.960" end="01:53.960">*</span><span begin="01:53.960" end="01:54.350">t </span><span begin="01:54.350" end="01:54.350">（</span><span begin="01:54.350" end="01:54.350">What </span><span begin="01:54.350" end="01:54.350">you </span><span begin="01:54.350" end="01:54.350">gonna </span><span begin="01:54.350" end="01:54.350">do</span><span begin="01:54.350" end="01:54.350">?</span><span begin="01:54.350" end="01:54.350">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.350" end="01:55.490"><span begin="01:54.350" end="01:54.620">People </span><span begin="01:54.620" end="01:54.650">= </span><span begin="01:54.650" end="01:54.770">Sh</span><span begin="01:54.770" end="01:55.190">*</span><span begin="01:55.190" end="01:55.490">t </span><span begin="01:55.490" end="01:55.490">（</span><span begin="01:55.490" end="01:55.490">Cause </span><span begin="01:55.490" end="01:55.490">I'm </span><span begin="01:55.490" end="01:55.490">not </span><span begin="01:55.490" end="01:55.490">afraid </span><span begin="01:55.490" end="01:55.490">of </span><span begin="01:55.490" end="01:55.490">you</span><span begin="01:55.490" end="01:55.490">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.490" end="01:56.360"><span begin="01:55.490" end="01:55.640">People </span><span begin="01:55.640" end="01:56.210">= </span><span begin="01:56.210" end="01:56.240">Sh</span><span begin="01:56.240" end="01:56.240">*</span><span begin="01:56.240" end="01:56.360">t </span><span begin="01:56.360" end="01:56.360">（</span><span begin="01:56.360" end="01:56.360">I'm </span><span begin="01:56.360" end="01:56.360">everything </span><span begin="01:56.360" end="01:56.360">yo